2011 - 2013 [34]Klarna AB, Stockholm, SWE Developer in FinTech

     Designed the public REST API of [35]Klarna Checkout - its core still
     60-80% the same today, across 26 markets, 15 years later - and wrote
     the API documentation used by integrating merchants.

     Checkout's whole pitch was "email + postal code, click buy" - so
     simple merchants couldn't trust it. I built a full front/backend FSM
     prototype that made the flow legible, and it became the sales tool
     that won merchant trust over the year the product was being built.
     As the Checkout team grew from 4 to 20-30 people, I built support
     tooling for engineers to learn, explore and extend what the API
     exposed - then moved to a 10-person API team to design the Klarna
     Backoffice API.

